        "topics": "MCP, multi-agent SecOps, prompt injection, agent identity",
        "description": "Running AI agents against real systems without opening a new way in for attackers. Covers Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers and the tool permissions they expose, prompt injection and tool poisoning, agent identity and least privilege, and multi-agent SecOps workflows a security team can audit.",
